<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong foreign reserves at US$66.6 bln end-May.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong foreign reserves at US$66.6 bln end-May.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's foreign reserves stood at US$66.6 billion at the end of May, US$3.0 billion up on the previous month, the Hong Kong Monetary Authority said.</p>
<p>The authority said in a news release that, including forward transactions, the reserves reached US$68.4 billion, compared to US$67.6 billion at the end of April.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
